      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a bit vague. i mean, i've been seeing a lot of reports lately suggesting that these programs don't actually have a measurable impact on the bottom line and are just a distraction for HR. is there any real, empirical evidence that they actually drive profit, or is that just the prevailing corporate narrative right now?",
